; Chart of accounts — persona moral (MX), régimen general de ley, patrón en Nuevo León.
; Applied with aurum.business.chart.apply_business_template(ws, "mx_persona_moral").
; Dates are the 2000-01-01 floor; accounts used before being listed here are opened at first use.
;
; The expense tree is grouped so /api/business/{ws}/kpis can report COGS, operating expenses by group
; and payroll cost without a per-workspace mapping: Expenses:COGS:*, Expenses:Payroll:*, Expenses:Opex:*.

option "operating_currency" "MXN"

; --- Assets ---------------------------------------------------------------
2000-01-01 open Assets:Bank:BBVA
2000-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Banorte
2000-01-01 open Assets:Bank:Santander
2000-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2000-01-01 open Assets:Receivable:Clients
2000-01-01 open Assets:Inventory
2000-01-01 open Assets:FixedAssets:Equipo
2000-01-01 open Assets:FixedAssets:Vehiculos
2000-01-01 open Assets:FixedAssets:Depreciacion-Acumulada
; IVA paid on purchases, creditable against IVA trasladado (LIVA art. 5).
2000-01-01 open Assets:Taxes:IVA-Acreditable
; IVA on PPD purchases not yet paid — creditable only once paid.
2000-01-01 open Assets:Taxes:IVA-Pendiente
2000-01-01 open Assets:Taxes:ISR-Retenido
2000-01-01 open Assets:Taxes:IVA-Retenido
2000-01-01 open Assets:Taxes:Pagos-Provisionales

; --- Liabilities ----------------------------------------------------------
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Payable:Suppliers
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:CreditCard:Empresa
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Loans:Bank
; Payroll: what is owed to the worker and to each institution after a nómina run.
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Payroll:Net
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Payroll:ISR-Retenido
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Payroll:IMSS-Obrero
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Payroll:IMSS-Patronal
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Payroll:INFONAVIT
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Payroll:ISN
; Federal taxes of the entity itself.
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Taxes:IVA-Trasladado
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Taxes:IVA-Trasladado-Pendiente
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Taxes:ISR-Payable
2000-01-01 open Liabilities:Taxes:PTU

; --- Equity ---------------------------------------------------------------
2000-01-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances
2000-01-01 open Equity:Capital-Social
2000-01-01 open Equity:Resultados-Acumulados

; --- Income ---------------------------------------------------------------
2000-01-01 open Income:Sales:Products
2000-01-01 open Income:Sales:Services
2000-01-01 open Income:Other
2000-01-01 open Income:Interest

; --- Cost of goods sold ---------------------------------------------------
2000-01-01 open Expenses:COGS:Materials
2000-01-01 open Expenses:COGS:Subcontractors
2000-01-01 open Expenses:COGS:Freight

; --- Payroll cost ---------------------------------------------------------
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Payroll:Sueldos
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Payroll:Aguinaldo
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Payroll:PrimaVacacional
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Payroll:IMSS-Patronal
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Payroll:INFONAVIT
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Payroll:ISN

; --- Operating expenses ---------------------------------------------------
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:Rent
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:Utilities
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:Software
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:Marketing
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:Professional
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:Travel
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:Office
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:Insurance
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:Depreciation
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:BankFees
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Opex:Other
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Financial:Interest
2000-01-01 open Expenses:Taxes:ISR
